{"seq":1,"slug":"vue-router-advanced","title":"Vue Router 进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/routing-and-ssr/vue-router-advanced","wordCount":428,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"vue-router-进阶\">Vue Router 进阶</h1><h2 id=\"路由系统概述\">路由系统概述</h2><p>Vue Router 是 Vue.js 的官方路由管理器，提供了嵌套路由、导航守卫、懒加载等强大功能。本文聚焦于进阶用法，帮助构建复杂的路由架构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    U[&quot;用户导航&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; BG[&quot;beforeEach(全局前置守卫)&quot;]&#10;    BG --&gt; BR[&quot;beforeEnter(路由独享守卫)&quot;]&#10;    BR --&gt; BC[&quot;beforeRouteEnter(组件守卫)&quot;]&#10;    BC --&gt; R[&quot;路由解析完成&quot;]&#10;    R --&gt; AG[&quot;afterEach(全局后置钩子)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    U[\"用户导航\"]\n    U --&gt; BG[\"beforeEach(全局前置守卫)\"]\n    BG --&gt; BR[\"beforeEnter(路由独享守卫)\"]\n    BR --&gt; BC[\"beforeRouteEnter(组件守卫)\"]\n    BC --&gt; R[\"路由解析完成\"]\n    R --&gt; AG[\"afterEach(全局后置钩子)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>导航守卫</strong>：在路由切换的不同节点插入的拦截函数，分全局（<code>beforeEach</code>/<code>afterEach</code>）、路由独享（<code>beforeEnter</code>）、组件内（<code>onBeforeRouteLeave</code>/<code>onBeforeRouteUpdate</code>）三层。</li>\n<li><strong>路由 meta</strong>：路由携带的元信息，配合守卫实现权限控制、标题设置、布局切换等横切逻辑。</li>\n<li><strong>路由懒加载</strong>：用动态 <code>import()</code> 把路由组件拆成独立代码块，按需加载以减小首屏体积。</li>\n<li><strong>动态路由</strong>：<code>addRoute</code> / <code>removeRoute</code> 在运行时增删路由表，适合权限驱动的菜单。</li>\n<li><strong>参数约束</strong>：路径参数支持正则约束，<code>pathMatch</code> 捕获兜底的 404 路由。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"导航守卫\">导航守卫</h2><h3 id=\"全局守卫\">全局守卫</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// router/index.ts&#10;import { createRouter, createWebHistory } from &#39;vue-router&#39;;&#10;import type { RouteLocationNormalized, NavigationGuardNext } from &#39;vue-router&#39;;&#10;&#10;const router = createRouter({&#10;  history: createWebHistory(),&#10;  routes: [&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  ],&#10;});&#10;&#10;router.beforeEach(async (to: RouteLocationNormalized, from: RouteLocationNormalized) =&gt; {&#10;  const authStore = useAuthStore();&#10;&#10;  if (to.meta.requiresAuth &amp;&amp; !authStore.isAuthenticated) {&#10;    return { name: &#39;login&#39;, query: { redirect: to.fullPath } };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  if (to.meta.requiresAdmin &amp;&amp; !authStore.isAdmin) {&#10;    return { name: &#39;forbidden&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;router.afterEach((to, from) =&gt; {&#10;  document.title = (to.meta.title as string) ?? &#39;默认标题&#39;;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// router/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createRouter, createWebHistory } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { RouteLocationNormalized, NavigationGuardNext } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue-router'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> router</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></s